[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799964750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105344#issuecomment-2799964750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105344","id":2799964750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m5BJO","user":{"login":"the-loki","id":40163921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTYzOTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40163921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki","html_url":"https://github.com/the-loki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T14:01:25Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T14:01:25Z","body":"> Tested locally and works. Code looks good to me.\r\n> \r\n> Only thing worth noting: the last dev release added support for changing the editor language on the fly. This PR does not yet support that, it might be worth recalculating the cache when the `NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED` is fired. (The entry point would be `GDScriptLanguageServer` which is a `Node` and receives notifications.)\r\n> \r\n> Not a dealbreaker for me, I'll let the production team decide whether this can be merged without support for dynamic language changing.\r\n\r\nThanks. i'll try to impl it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799964750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800025483","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105344#issuecomment-2800025483","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105344","id":2800025483,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m5P-L","user":{"login":"the-loki","id":40163921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTYzOTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40163921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki","html_url":"https://github.com/the-loki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-loki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T16:39:34Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T16:39:34Z","body":"> Tested locally and works. Code looks good to me.\r\n> \r\n> Only thing worth noting: the last dev release added support for changing the editor language on the fly. This PR does not yet support that, it might be worth recalculating the cache when the `NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED` is fired. (The entry point would be `GDScriptLanguageServer` which is a `Node` and receives notifications.)\r\n> \r\n> Not a dealbreaker for me, I'll let the production team decide whether this can be merged without support for dynamic language changing.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> support for changing the editor language on the fly.\r\n\r\nI tried the runtime support for language switching locally, but it doesn't behave as expected in vscode, it behaves normally in some cases such as hover, but if you open a document of a class in vscode, and then switch the language, unless you restart vscode, the language of the class will always be the original setting anyway, I think it might be some kind of cache in vscode plugin.\r\nI think this might be some kind of cache in the vscode plugin.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800025483/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2800055614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105344#issuecomment-2800055614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105344","id":2800055614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m5XU-","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/eve